Subject: [PATCH 30/64] =?UTF-8?q?P4:=20gait=20presentation=20=E2=80=94=20s?=
 =?UTF-8?q?print=20gun-lower,=20bob,=20fire=20cancels=20sprint?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Sell walk/jog/sprint in first person without new viewmodel anims:
attack clears COD_SF_SPRINTING same frame so the shot fires; procedural
gun-lower raises visually only; gait-scaled bob rates/amps and sprint
camera/FOV weight behind cod_gaitEnable.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
